  "text": "Hello Professor Alvarez,\n\nI'd like to book our 30-minute 1:1 for next week. The free slots in my calendar are:\n\n- Monday 10:00-10:30\n- Monday 14:00-14:30\n- Tuesday 11:00-11:30\n- Tuesday 15:00-15:30\n- Wednesday 10:00-10:30\n\nWould any of those work for you? Happy to fit around whatever you have.\n\nJohn",
